## Performance for SEO

```typescript
// next.config.js
module.exports = {
  // Image optimization
  images: {
    formats: ['image/avif', 'image/webp'],
    minimumCacheTTL: 60,
  },
  
  // Compression
  compress: true,
  
  // Headers for performance
  async headers() {
    return [
      {
        source: '/(.*)',
        headers: [
          {
            key: 'Cache-Control',
            value: 'public, max-age=3600, must-revalidate'
          }
        ]
      }
    ];
  }
};
```

## SEO Monitoring

```typescript
// lib/seo/monitor.ts
export function trackSEOMetrics() {
  // Track Core Web Vitals
  trackCoreWebVitals();
  
  // Track search performance (if Search Console API available)
  if (typeof window !== 'undefined') {
    // Monitor 404s
    window.addEventListener('error', (e) => {
      if (e.message.includes('404')) {
        track('404 Error', { path: window.location.pathname });
      }
    });
    
    // Monitor search queries (limited)
    const referrer = document.referrer;
    if (referrer.includes('google.com')) {
      track('Organic Visit', { source: 'google' });
    }
  }
}
```

## 21-Step Verification

1. Title tags unique per page
2. Meta descriptions under 160 chars
3. Open Graph tags present
4. Twitter Cards configured
5. Canonical URLs set
6. Sitemap generated
7. Robots.txt configured
8. Structured data implemented
9. Semantic HTML structure
10. Images have alt text
11. URLs are SEO-friendly
12. Internal links working
13. No broken links (check with tool)
14. Mobile responsive
15. Core Web Vitals passing
16. HTTPS enabled
17. Page load < 3 seconds
18. No index on admin pages
19. Breadcrumb navigation
20. 404 page configured
21. Lighthouse score > 90
